(4196525, 604621, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe, but a little too tight for something that would run A1 above the fold.</td>', 'maybe, but a little too tight for something that would run A1 above the fold.', '2007-10-26 01:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196529, 604536, 23394, '<td valign="top">too cluttered, too removed.  stronger photos bring you in; they don''t make you feel like trying to find a way out.</td>', 'too cluttered, too removed.  stronger photos bring you in; they don''t make you feel like trying to find a way out.', '2007-10-26 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196530, 604150, 15711, '<td valign="top">She''s right in the thick of what she does.  Works well for the challenge but I wish we could see more of her "in action."  Love the blowing hair.</td>', 'She''s right in the thick of what she does.  Works well for the challenge but I wish we could see more of her "in action."  Love the blowing hair.', '2007-10-26 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196531, 604449, 67237, '<td valign="top">good focus, exposure and wb.<br/>composition could be better if a bit tighter at the bottom and the coach was not in the back.</td>', 'good focus, exposure and wb.composition could be better if a bit tighter at the bottom and the coach was not in the back.', '2007-10-26 01:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196533, 603574, 23394, '<td valign="top">pretty, pretty, yes, but front page?  no.</td>', 'pretty, pretty, yes, but front page?  no.', '2007-10-26 01:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196535, 603693, 23394, '<td valign="top">nah, don''t really see this being on the front page, unless it''s a really, really, really slow news day...</td>', 'nah, don''t really see this being on the front page, unless it''s a really, really, really slow news day...', '2007-10-26 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196538, 602697, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but i don''t see this making the front page...</td>', 'sorry, but i don''t see this making the front page...', '2007-10-26 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196542, 604306, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sad scenario for all of the California victims. I hate the title - seems a bit insensitive, considering the situation. Maybe I''m just being too soft hearted. It certainly tells a story, even without the title, so it fits photojournalism just fine.</td>', 'Sad scenario for all of the California victims. I hate the title - seems a bit insensitive, considering the situation. Maybe I''m just being too soft hearted. It certainly tells a story, even without the title, so it fits photojournalism just fine.', '2007-10-26 01:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196543, 602939, 67237, '<td valign="top">hmmm it''s kind of dificult to buy that the nice looking black girl with stereo headphones simbolices either africa or a victim of aids.</td>', 'hmmm it''s kind of dificult to buy that the nice looking black girl with stereo headphones simbolices either africa or a victim of aids.', '2007-10-26 01:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196546, 602755, 23394, '<td valign="top">not the greatest shot, but definitely has potential as a pj shot.  if your equipment can handle it, try shooting this without the flash.  also, try to find a different perspective than straight-on eye-level documentation.</td>', 'not the greatest shot, but definitely has potential as a pj shot.  if your equipment can handle it, try shooting this without the flash.  also, try to find a different perspective than straight-on eye-level documentation.', '2007-10-26 01:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196548, 602352, 67237, '<td valign="top">too many blown outs in the backhground..you needed a larger aperture ( to get a less distracting bg) and some fill light for this shot.</td>', 'too many blown outs in the backhground..you needed a larger aperture ( to get a less distracting bg) and some fill light for this shot.', '2007-10-26 01:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196550, 604357, 23394, '<td valign="top">stop the presses!</td>', 'stop the presses!', '2007-10-26 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196555, 604831, 23394, '<td valign="top">bingo!  a really killer shot would have been to have gotten a shot of her holding up something she found.  while this image helps tell the story, something closer in would have made people take it to heart.</td>', 'bingo!  a really killer shot would have been to have gotten a shot of her holding up something she found.  while this image helps tell the story, something closer in would have made people take it to heart.', '2007-10-26 01:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196557, 604051, 67237, '<td valign="top">I think this type of frontal perspective looks a bit too flat in this kind of shots. It does not look professional but snappish.  A wider lens and a closer approach could have add a little nice dramatism and pro look.</td>', 'I think this type of frontal perspective looks a bit too flat in this kind of shots. It does not look professional but snappish.  A wider lens and a closer approach could have add a little nice dramatism and pro look.', '2007-10-26 01:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196558, 604276, 23394, '<td valign="top">nah.  too remote to really connect the viewer with the situation.  doesn''t really tell a story.</td>', 'nah.  too remote to really connect the viewer with the situation.  doesn''t really tell a story.', '2007-10-26 01:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196559, 603847, 67237, '<td valign="top">hmmm, so this is an entry for photojournalism...I don''t know what to say..I think it just doesn''t work</td>', 'hmmm, so this is an entry for photojournalism...I don''t know what to say..I think it just doesn''t work', '2007-10-26 01:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196562, 604829, 23394, '<td valign="top">you''re on the right track, but this image is too removed to really connect the viewer with the situation.  the news truck is a nice backdrop, though.</td>', 'you''re on the right track, but this image is too removed to really connect the viewer with the situation.  the news truck is a nice backdrop, though.', '2007-10-26 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196567, 602973, 67237, '<td valign="top">I don''t know who JW is, but that''s not important anyway.<br/>Focus is ok . But exposure or lighting, wb and particularly the composition could be better.<br/>I also think the theme does not work for a front page..don''t you agree?</td>', 'I don''t know who JW is, but that''s not important anyway.Focus is ok . But exposure or lighting, wb and particularly the composition could be better.I also think the theme does not work for a front page..don''t you agree?', '2007-10-26 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196568, 604749, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.  not necessarily what i''d consider a front-pager on the A section, but could easily see this as a front-page shot on an inside section.</td>', 'excellent shot.  not necessarily what i''d consider a front-pager on the A section, but could easily see this as a front-page shot on an inside section.', '2007-10-26 01:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196569, 604636, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  not necessarily what i''d consider a front-pager on the A section, but could easily see this as a front-page shot on an inside section.</td>', 'nice shot.  not necessarily what i''d consider a front-pager on the A section, but could easily see this as a front-page shot on an inside section.', '2007-10-26 01:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196575, 604692, 67237, '<td valign="top">ohhh those white plastic bags..they are everywhere and I hate them, but that is not relevant to judge the merits of the photo.<br/>good focus, and exposure despite the inevitable blown outs on the plastic bags.<br/>Composition could be much better withe the same lens yiou used, or even better with a wider lens and a closer approach. I will give you a 5</td>', 'ohhh those white plastic bags..they are everywhere and I hate them, but that is not relevant to judge the merits of the photo.good focus, and exposure despite the inevitable blown outs on the plastic bags.Composition could be much better withe the same lens yiou used, or even better with a wider lens and a closer approach. I will give you a 5', '2007-10-26 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196578, 604150, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice image, well composed, lit, exposed, etc.<br/>but I do not see this as a convincing entry for a photojournalism challenge...sorry.</td>', 'nice image, well composed, lit, exposed, etc.but I do not see this as a convincing entry for a photojournalism challenge...sorry.', '2007-10-26 01:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196583, 604611, 67237, '<td valign="top">yes, it works since it does show summer action <br/>I like it , but I would like it even more if you could have solved the exposure and composition problems with those bright elements on the left side....7</td>', 'yes, it works since it does show summer action I like it , but I would like it even more if you could have solved the exposure and composition problems with those bright elements on the left side....7', '2007-10-26 01:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196585, 604805, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work.  great example of less is more.  one of the best i''ve seen so far, especially considering that it doesn''t even need a caption to tell its story.</td>', 'excellent work.  great example of less is more.  one of the best i''ve seen so far, especially considering that it doesn''t even need a caption to tell its story.', '2007-10-26 01:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196586, 604817, 67237, '<td valign="top">the total lack of expressions on the subjects ruines this image for me. besides the serious composition and light problems.</td>', 'the total lack of expressions on the subjects ruines this image for me. besides the serious composition and light problems.', '2007-10-26 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196588, 604094, 23394, '<td valign="top">cool shot, but needs something to tell its story; as is, it''s more art than pj.</td>', 'cool shot, but needs something to tell its story; as is, it''s more art than pj.', '2007-10-26 01:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196589, 604710, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like this image, but not as pj material.</td>', 'i like this image, but not as pj material.', '2007-10-26 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196590, 604472, 23394, '<td valign="top">there''s a place for this image, but i don''t think it''s on the front page of a newspaper.</td>', 'there''s a place for this image, but i don''t think it''s on the front page of a newspaper.', '2007-10-26 01:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196591, 602966, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a splendid shot!  great pj work!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-18 21:56:58.</i></td>', 'what a splendid shot!  great pj work!!', '2007-10-26 01:57:35.000000', '2008-02-18 21:56:58.000000', 1),
