(4196603, 602754, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the cute little fellas and fillies... but I would like to have seen it a little more cropped to give the ''feeling'' of overpopulation. Hope you know what I mean!!! (7)</td>', 'Nice shot of the cute little fellas and fillies... but I would like to have seen it a little more cropped to give the ''feeling'' of overpopulation. Hope you know what I mean!!! (7)', '2007-10-26 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
