(4196605, 604636, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of life... but not really a great one for this challenge. But then... I have only scored once above 5.0 so what do I <i>really</i> know...eh?? (6)</td>', 'Nice shot of life... but not really a great one for this challenge. But then... I have only scored once above 5.0 so what do I really know...eh?? (6)', '2007-10-26 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
