(4196620, 604472, 74371, '<td valign="top">I would say DNMC but since I am not sure what you are trying to say...I won''t. But the picture is too dark to be really seen. The silhouette is nice but maybe a little lighting would have improved the overall shot! (4)</td>', 'I would say DNMC but since I am not sure what you are trying to say...I won''t. But the picture is too dark to be really seen. The silhouette is nice but maybe a little lighting would have improved the overall shot! (4)', '2007-10-26 02:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4196621, 604118, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice work.  nice perspective, nice composition.</td>', 'very nice work.  nice perspective, nice composition.', '2007-10-26 02:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
