(4198482, 604749, 23251, '<td valign="top">Carpentry or Carving?  Nice shot but I''m not sure how newsworthy it would be.  Maybe in the travel area or as you have pointed out a Carpentry magazine. Good Luck.</td>', 'Carpentry or Carving?  Nice shot but I''m not sure how newsworthy it would be.  Maybe in the travel area or as you have pointed out a Carpentry magazine. Good Luck.', '2007-10-26 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
