(4198496, 602973, 23251, '<td valign="top">Who is JW? I suppose if that is a well known person who has had a memorial placed in their honour it may appear in a newspaper.  There is quite a bit of free space at the top of the frame.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Who is JW? I suppose if that is a well known person who has had a memorial placed in their honour it may appear in a newspaper.  There is quite a bit of free space at the top of the frame.  Good Luck.', '2007-10-26 22:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198502, 604173, 23251, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is more about the face than the cloths as the title suggests.  The photo is good but does not really show cold/weather.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I think this photo is more about the face than the cloths as the title suggests.  The photo is good but does not really show cold/weather.  Good Luck.', '2007-10-26 22:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198505, 603787, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Scoring this high. Nit pick, the focus seems to be on the fire rather than making the fire fighter sharp.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great shot! Scoring this high. Nit pick, the focus seems to be on the fire rather than making the fire fighter sharp.  Good Luck.', '2007-10-26 22:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198577, 604395, 66348, '<td valign="top">Really great capture. I truly love the expression on her face. I really like the composition, I feel there is a bit of movement on her face but its not that distracting. Still my highest rated shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Really great capture. I truly love the expression on her face. I really like the composition, I feel there is a bit of movement on her face but its not that distracting. Still my highest rated shot. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198579, 604387, 66348, '<td valign="top">Such a powerful image. Even if this isn''t San Diego it still has meaning in the picture, especially for me, being from San Diego. I really like your composition and its a great title. I think its a great capture and hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Such a powerful image. Even if this isn''t San Diego it still has meaning in the picture, especially for me, being from San Diego. I really like your composition and its a great title. I think its a great capture and hope it does well for you.', '2007-10-26 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198592, 604358, 66348, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great capture of my home town. Its so sad what has happened, and I believe that you have captured a very powerful image. I think it has great composition and nice colors. Nice work.</td>', 'I think this is a great capture of my home town. Its so sad what has happened, and I believe that you have captured a very powerful image. I think it has great composition and nice colors. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198599, 604007, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I really think a lot of people tried to capture a walk, but your the only one that got a close up of the walkers faces. Much more believeable picture. Nice work and grea capture.</td>', 'Great capture. I really think a lot of people tried to capture a walk, but your the only one that got a close up of the walkers faces. Much more believeable picture. Nice work and grea capture.', '2007-10-26 23:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198603, 604059, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the expression, and really like your take on the challenge. Great composition. Nice work.</td>', 'Great capture. I love the expression, and really like your take on the challenge. Great composition. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198611, 604781, 66348, '<td valign="top">I really like your take on the challenge. Very powerful statement. The angle you approached and composition really work for this shot. Great B&amp;W conversion. I think this shot in advanced would have crushed any street photography challenge out there. Great work.</td>', 'I really like your take on the challenge. Very powerful statement. The angle you approached and composition really work for this shot. Great B&W conversion. I think this shot in advanced would have crushed any street photography challenge out there. Great work.', '2007-10-26 23:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198620, 602939, 66348, '<td valign="top">I think you captured a powerful image, however there is just no pain or suffering in your image. Let me explain. I believe having AIDS in Africa is a huge ordeal, yet the girl is sitting with head phones, not even seeming to have a care in the world. I think if she was more involved with the shot it would be better. I think you picked a great topic however, and I really do like the shot. Nice work.</td>', 'I think you captured a powerful image, however there is just no pain or suffering in your image. Let me explain. I believe having AIDS in Africa is a huge ordeal, yet the girl is sitting with head phones, not even seeming to have a care in the world. I think if she was more involved with the shot it would be better. I think you picked a great topic however, and I really do like the shot. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198627, 603787, 66348, '<td valign="top">I really hope this does well, but I fear for the out of focus fire fighter. I think this could be the winning shot if he were in focus. I really hope this does well though because its a great shot, with great composition and great colors. Nice work.</td>', 'I really hope this does well, but I fear for the out of focus fire fighter. I think this could be the winning shot if he were in focus. I really hope this does well though because its a great shot, with great composition and great colors. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198632, 604801, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors. I think it has great DOF and fills the frame very well. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors. I think it has great DOF and fills the frame very well. Nice work.', '2007-10-26 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198658, 602352, 84440, '<td valign="top">great photo. the blown out areas sure detract. without minimal editing, these could be easily repaired.</td>', 'great photo. the blown out areas sure detract. without minimal editing, these could be easily repaired.', '2007-10-26 23:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198677, 604140, 77196, '<td valign="top">A little tighter crop to remove the fence and the wind sock would have helped. Otherwise this is a very nice shot.</td>', 'A little tighter crop to remove the fence and the wind sock would have helped. Otherwise this is a very nice shot.', '2007-10-27 00:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198686, 604705, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I fail to see how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I fail to see how it meets the challenge.', '2007-10-27 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198689, 604575, 77196, '<td valign="top">Somehow I can''t see this as a lead photo for either a newspaper article or a magazine cover.</td>', 'Somehow I can''t see this as a lead photo for either a newspaper article or a magazine cover.', '2007-10-27 00:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198692, 603843, 77196, '<td valign="top">I thought they''d outlawed that in GB - or was that just with hounds?</td>', 'I thought they''d outlawed that in GB - or was that just with hounds?', '2007-10-27 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198871, 604387, 75713, '<td valign="top">I voted this image a 9 - came back to take a second look to add comments...this photo tugs at my heart strings because it shows such a normal, every day thing... sitting at the table, looking out at the view.. beautifully photographed, tells a strong story, elicits an emotional response.. bumping it to a 10 - good job!!</td>', 'I voted this image a 9 - came back to take a second look to add comments...this photo tugs at my heart strings because it shows such a normal, every day thing... sitting at the table, looking out at the view.. beautifully photographed, tells a strong story, elicits an emotional response.. bumping it to a 10 - good job!!', '2007-10-27 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198926, 604781, 79720, '<td valign="top">Tronna! I recognize the TTC, the shelter, and I think I even gave that homeless person some change last year.</td>', 'Tronna! I recognize the TTC, the shelter, and I think I even gave that homeless person some change last year.', '2007-10-27 02:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4198937, 604779, 79720, '<td valign="top">Oh, how I wish this could have been lit differently instead of with a direct on-camera flash.</td>', 'Oh, how I wish this could have been lit differently instead of with a direct on-camera flash.', '2007-10-27 02:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199031, 604387, 27133, '<td valign="top">Okay...so this is the winner.  But I have to say...it NEEDS A LEVELS ADJUSTMENT!!!!!  LOL!!</td>', 'Okay...so this is the winner.  But I have to say...it NEEDS A LEVELS ADJUSTMENT!!!!!  LOL!!', '2007-10-27 03:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
