(4199088, 604694, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and I think that it would do better if maybe you had set it up with a person or persons doing aa archaeological dig. Now I know that this is easier to set up but the shot could have been set up in a sandbox and cropped tight for effect.  Archaeoloigests Unearth Ancient Computing Device in State Park. Just a thought:-}</td>', 'This is a nice idea and I think that it would do better if maybe you had set it up with a person or persons doing aa archaeological dig. Now I know that this is easier to set up but the shot could have been set up in a sandbox and cropped tight for effect.  Archaeoloigests Unearth Ancient Computing Device in State Park. Just a thought:-}', '2007-10-27 06:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199090, 603787, 64568, '<td valign="top">Got to be the winner 10</td>', 'Got to be the winner 10', '2007-10-27 06:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199092, 604051, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice approach with this shot. A little to much light and slightly blown out in the back, but these things could have been fixed if the edit rules had been different. All in all the photo tells us a story and with the officials in it measuring the car it helps to further it along. There is a nice flow to your shot and the added movement of the lookers on works well for you. Nice capture sot the sports page.</td>', 'Nice approach with this shot. A little to much light and slightly blown out in the back, but these things could have been fixed if the edit rules had been different. All in all the photo tells us a story and with the officials in it measuring the car it helps to further it along. There is a nice flow to your shot and the added movement of the lookers on works well for you. Nice capture sot the sports page.', '2007-10-27 06:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199093, 604387, 64568, '<td valign="top">In my top 3, great shot and emotion, the chair makes this in IMO, great. 10</td>', 'In my top 3, great shot and emotion, the chair makes this in IMO, great. 10', '2007-10-27 06:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199095, 604007, 64568, '<td valign="top">top 3 for me, 9</td>', 'top 3 for me, 9', '2007-10-27 06:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199099, 604369, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice staged event. I like that you used B&amp;W for this and didn''t overdo the action. it is simple and it works. If I could offer one thing, that would be the use of the staires, you have an awsome location for this shot and I think that you could have had old bats carring her down the staires in a firemans carry. In my opinion it would of had more punch and when you think about the relationship that he has with the media, you as a reporter for the Gothum news paper would hardly catch old bat ears in such a static pose. Just me thiugh and not the end for this shot. I think you should do well with inspite of my take on things. Best of luck.</td>', 'Nice staged event. I like that you used B&W for this and didn''t overdo the action. it is simple and it works. If I could offer one thing, that would be the use of the staires, you have an awsome location for this shot and I think that you could have had old bats carring her down the staires in a firemans carry. In my opinion it would of had more punch and when you think about the relationship that he has with the media, you as a reporter for the Gothum news paper would hardly catch old bat ears in such a static pose. Just me thiugh and not the end for this shot. I think you should do well with inspite of my take on things. Best of luck.', '2007-10-27 07:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4199103, 602352, 75034, '<td valign="top">Viking, viking, viking... What about the vikins? The whole idea with a challenge like this (I think so anyway) is to draw the reader in. When you look through your local newspaper the headlines have about .5sec to grab you and make you want to read the story, so in this case you need to bring your "A" game.  So something along the lines of " Vikings Promise New World Order" or "Long Forgotten Vikings Resurface as World Deals With History Now" or something to that effect. I hope this helps. Keep in mind that the title alone is no real reflection for how well your image will be recieved in a challenge under normal challenge submissions but in a challenge such as Photojournallism I think you need to use the title as the hook and your shot as the story. REMBER I''m only one opinion <br/> <br/>Now onto the shot. The subject is "TAC" sharp and interesting this was a nice find for you. The colour conversion is spot on and the lighting is great. Sometimes lighting is hard even under advanced edit rules, but you did an awsome job here with Minimal and in Jpeg to boot. This must of been a fun event to attend. Anytime Vikings are involved you can count on action. Good luck this should do well based on the shot alone, but with an in your face headline you would have done better in my opinion.</td>', 'Viking, viking, viking... What about the vikins? The whole idea with a challenge like this (I think so anyway) is to draw the reader in. When you look through your local newspaper the headlines have about .5sec to grab you and make you want to read the story, so in this case you need to bring your "A" game.  So something along the lines of " Vikings Promise New World Order" or "Long Forgotten Vikings Resurface as World Deals With History Now" or something to that effect. I hope this helps. Keep in mind that the title alone is no real reflection for how well your image will be recieved in a challenge under normal challenge submissions but in a challenge such as Photojournallism I think you need to use the title as the hook and your shot as the story. REMBER I''m only one opinion  Now onto the shot. The subject is "TAC" sharp and interesting this was a nice find for you. The colour conversion is spot on and the lighting is great. Sometimes lighting is hard even under advanced edit rules, but you did an awsome job here with Minimal and in Jpeg to boot. This must of been a fun event to attend. Anytime Vikings are involved you can count on action. Good luck this should do well based on the shot alone, but with an in your face headline you would have done better in my opinion.', '2007-10-27 07:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
