(4200320, 604474, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, there is a lot going on in your image. I''m not quite sure what the story or main focal point is. I see the firemen, a pregnant woman, a school bus. Not quite sure how they all tie in. I like the lighting.</td>', 'For me, there is a lot going on in your image. I''m not quite sure what the story or main focal point is. I see the firemen, a pregnant woman, a school bus. Not quite sure how they all tie in. I like the lighting.', '2007-10-27 23:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4200323, 604306, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of your image. With your image, I find the title distasteful and in poor humor, but that''s me and I certainly don''t hold that against the photo itself.</td>', 'I like the symmetry of your image. With your image, I find the title distasteful and in poor humor, but that''s me and I certainly don''t hold that against the photo itself.', '2007-10-27 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
