(4200329, 604781, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s not a bad image. It doesn''t hold my interest for too long. Perhaps if there had been one or two additional people standing by it would have been more effective.</td>', 'For me, it''s not a bad image. It doesn''t hold my interest for too long. Perhaps if there had been one or two additional people standing by it would have been more effective.', '2007-10-27 23:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
