(4200336, 604812, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) To me, your title is stretching it a bit to fit the challenge, but I like the lighting, patterns and texture in your photo.</td>', ':-) To me, your title is stretching it a bit to fit the challenge, but I like the lighting, patterns and texture in your photo.', '2007-10-27 23:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
