(4200344, 604593, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your title doesn''t tie in well with your photo, but I don''t take that into account with my scoring. I like the lighting, composition is okay. I get a sense that wherever this is there was a garbage strike or something.</td>', 'For me, your title doesn''t tie in well with your photo, but I don''t take that into account with my scoring. I like the lighting, composition is okay. I get a sense that wherever this is there was a garbage strike or something.', '2007-10-27 23:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
