(4201679, 604621, 75034, '<td valign="top">Compelling and heart felt, you look to have a personal interest in your subject and that''s not a bad thing when you''re shooting human interest pieces. I like the tight shot and the intensity in his eyes. You can tell that he''s a fighter and has a positive out look on life inspite of the chemo.<br/> <br/>Your desaturation is nice and I like the slight colour on the ears and lips (at least I can see some colour on my monitor) it''s a good edit for minimal and I hope you do very well with this shot. In my opinion, it is very well done.</td>', 'Compelling and heart felt, you look to have a personal interest in your subject and that''s not a bad thing when you''re shooting human interest pieces. I like the tight shot and the intensity in his eyes. You can tell that he''s a fighter and has a positive out look on life inspite of the chemo. Your desaturation is nice and I like the slight colour on the ears and lips (at least I can see some colour on my monitor) it''s a good edit for minimal and I hope you do very well with this shot. In my opinion, it is very well done.', '2007-10-28 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4201686, 604094, 75034, '<td valign="top">...and page three, page four, page five..... Have you noticed that the amount of corruption in big and small town politics has really gone up. This is very relevent and compele us to read on. Great shot with the fish eye, the colours and tones are great, good work.</td>', '...and page three, page four, page five..... Have you noticed that the amount of corruption in big and small town politics has really gone up. This is very relevent and compele us to read on. Great shot with the fish eye, the colours and tones are great, good work.', '2007-10-28 17:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
