(4203818, 602482, 173, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good shot, but it looks like there could have been some slight adjustment on your exposure to make the photo a little more crisp. Other than that it have nice composition.</td>', 'I think this is a good shot, but it looks like there could have been some slight adjustment on your exposure to make the photo a little more crisp. Other than that it have nice composition.', '2007-10-29 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203821, 604358, 59267, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture! 10</td>', 'Awesome capture! 10', '2007-10-29 14:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4203872, 604276, 173, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really poor on this shot and it doesnt appear to be for any particular reason. Maybe some better contrast would have helped some. Keep on trying though! The more pics you take and enter the better you will get.</td>', 'The lighting is really poor on this shot and it doesnt appear to be for any particular reason. Maybe some better contrast would have helped some. Keep on trying though! The more pics you take and enter the better you will get.', '2007-10-29 14:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204061, 602973, 64670, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I think for it to work in this category it would need to have less negative space on top and appear less skewed at the base.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I think for it to work in this category it would need to have less negative space on top and appear less skewed at the base.', '2007-10-29 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204062, 604549, 64670, '<td valign="top">Really good subject matter for Australians.  So typical the dry soil through the hands and a good look on the mans face to marry with the title.</td>', 'Really good subject matter for Australians.  So typical the dry soil through the hands and a good look on the mans face to marry with the title.', '2007-10-29 15:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204064, 604694, 64670, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, I think it works well.  For this I would have been tempted to go B&amp;W.</td>', 'Cool idea, I think it works well.  For this I would have been tempted to go B&W.', '2007-10-29 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204066, 604698, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh well done!  Great colours and good location shot.</td>', 'Oh well done!  Great colours and good location shot.', '2007-10-29 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204068, 602834, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great effort, the excessive saturation of reds makes it quite hard on the eyes.</td>', 'Great effort, the excessive saturation of reds makes it quite hard on the eyes.', '2007-10-29 15:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204070, 604173, 64670, '<td valign="top">Exceptional portrait - amazing what you''ve achieved with such minimal rule set.</td>', 'Exceptional portrait - amazing what you''ve achieved with such minimal rule set.', '2007-10-29 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204072, 604059, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  However the lighting at the time of exposure was not going to do you any favours particularly without being able to work the image in post processing.</td>', 'Great subject.  However the lighting at the time of exposure was not going to do you any favours particularly without being able to work the image in post processing.', '2007-10-29 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204074, 604158, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great image, so clear.  It''s a real pity you didn''t have a reflector it would have made this perfect.  As it stands the shadows over the face, particularly the ideas is less than ideal.</td>', 'Great image, so clear.  It''s a real pity you didn''t have a reflector it would have made this perfect.  As it stands the shadows over the face, particularly the ideas is less than ideal.', '2007-10-29 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204075, 604749, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW - I love these slice of life imaages.  The browns are just awesome and the shadows through the matting on the walls are lovely.</td>', 'Oh WOW - I love these slice of life imaages.  The browns are just awesome and the shadows through the matting on the walls are lovely.', '2007-10-29 16:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204079, 604642, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh YES!  Great slice of life image - love the tones - not like you have much choice out in the desert - GRIN!</td>', 'Oh YES!  Great slice of life image - love the tones - not like you have much choice out in the desert - GRIN!', '2007-10-29 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204296, 604742, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. For me however, the grays seem very flat. Too bad about the minimal editing - the use of curves and contrast would really aid this image.</td>', 'I like your idea. For me however, the grays seem very flat. Too bad about the minimal editing - the use of curves and contrast would really aid this image.', '2007-10-29 17:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204299, 604710, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the ponies, but reading your title, then looking at the image with no cars, it''s hard to see how they tied up traffic. It also looks like they crossed pretty quick. It does make me smile though.</td>', 'I like the ponies, but reading your title, then looking at the image with no cars, it''s hard to see how they tied up traffic. It also looks like they crossed pretty quick. It does make me smile though.', '2007-10-29 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204303, 604809, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your image gives me the idea an article might be more about parking issues, rather than downtown vacancies or demise. I do like the low angle of your photo though.</td>', 'For me, your image gives me the idea an article might be more about parking issues, rather than downtown vacancies or demise. I do like the low angle of your photo though.', '2007-10-29 17:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4204851, 602143, 43056, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-10-29 23:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
