(4206593, 603843, 69776, '<td valign="top">Ohhh if only we could have cropped, but still great image, good luck</td>', 'Ohhh if only we could have cropped, but still great image, good luck', '2007-10-30 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206596, 604593, 69776, '<td valign="top">looks like it has the potential to really tell a story but your title just confuses me.</td>', 'looks like it has the potential to really tell a story but your title just confuses me.', '2007-10-30 20:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206597, 604781, 69776, '<td valign="top">Looks great Max, good title as well.  Fingers crossed :)<br/>(no vote from me btw)</td>', 'Looks great Max, good title as well.  Fingers crossed :)(no vote from me btw)', '2007-10-30 20:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206702, 603574, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, had the color been more vibrant or maybe desaturated 100%, I would have scored it higher. With the subdued colors it looks flat to me. I do like the composition and tight closeup.</td>', 'For me, had the color been more vibrant or maybe desaturated 100%, I would have scored it higher. With the subdued colors it looks flat to me. I do like the composition and tight closeup.', '2007-10-30 21:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206714, 602482, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s an average photo of the Seattle skyline. There''s nothing in it to make it pop or standout from similar photos.</td>', 'For me, it''s an average photo of the Seattle skyline. There''s nothing in it to make it pop or standout from similar photos.', '2007-10-30 22:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206716, 604736, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s an okay photo, but there are so many trees in front of the bridge it''s very distracting and lessens the impact of the bridge.</td>', 'For me, it''s an okay photo, but there are so many trees in front of the bridge it''s very distracting and lessens the impact of the bridge.', '2007-10-30 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206721, 603843, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had your image been closer - more focused on the riders and maybe deeper color saturation, I would have scored it a point or two higher.</td>', 'Had your image been closer - more focused on the riders and maybe deeper color saturation, I would have scored it a point or two higher.', '2007-10-30 22:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206724, 604472, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your image isn''t terrible, yet for me there isn''t anything in it to make me say "wow." Maybe if you were able to zoom in closer or take the photo with less of the trees it would be more interesting to me.</td>', 'Your image isn''t terrible, yet for me there isn''t anything in it to make me say "wow." Maybe if you were able to zoom in closer or take the photo with less of the trees it would be more interesting to me.', '2007-10-30 22:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206727, 604568, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find the man on the left distracting. I do like the kids playing - I get the impression they''re having fun and maybe a little scared of the "big people." Also, the sky is blown out and makes it look harsh.</td>', 'I find the man on the left distracting. I do like the kids playing - I get the impression they''re having fun and maybe a little scared of the "big people." Also, the sky is blown out and makes it look harsh.', '2007-10-30 22:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206728, 604094, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your image, yet when I try to imagine this in a newspaper - using your title - it doesn''t seem to quite fit together. Perhaps if there were two business people/politicians it would be more effective.</td>', 'I like your image, yet when I try to imagine this in a newspaper - using your title - it doesn''t seem to quite fit together. Perhaps if there were two business people/politicians it would be more effective.', '2007-10-30 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4206750, 604428, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, his expression doesn''t quite come across as anger. More like concentration to me. I do like the off-centered composition though.</td>', 'For me, his expression doesn''t quite come across as anger. More like concentration to me. I do like the off-centered composition though.', '2007-10-30 22:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4207020, 604831, 50695, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/>Duh, I thought this challenge was ending and I was in a hurry. Ah, so now I can breathe, relax, and tell you what incredible photojournalism this is, and also art. You''ve caught this moment within a moment, a moment of awareness of YOU caught inside a moment of searching, a moment before she becomes self-conscious, when she is searching for a connection, a meaning, and she looks up in that search, away from what she thought she was searching for. The symphony of subject in context here is unmistakable, inevitable, surprising.</td>', ' Posthumous Blue Ribbon Duh, I thought this challenge was ending and I was in a hurry. Ah, so now I can breathe, relax, and tell you what incredible photojournalism this is, and also art. You''ve caught this moment within a moment, a moment of awareness of YOU caught inside a moment of searching, a moment before she becomes self-conscious, when she is searching for a connection, a meaning, and she looks up in that search, away from what she thought she was searching for. The symphony of subject in context here is unmistakable, inevitable, surprising.', '2007-10-31 00:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
