(4210034, 604051, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well framed in camera.  A bit harsh light in places but that''s obviously the light you had to work with.  Title fits it well; a realistic shot of the activity.</td>', 'Well framed in camera.  A bit harsh light in places but that''s obviously the light you had to work with.  Title fits it well; a realistic shot of the activity.', '2007-10-31 22:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210042, 604831, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice commentary on the arbitrary nature of fire - this house is gone yet the ones behind it are still there.  Well captured and nice framing (other than the spike in the middle) to show this capricious nature of fire.</td>', 'A nice commentary on the arbitrary nature of fire - this house is gone yet the ones behind it are still there.  Well captured and nice framing (other than the spike in the middle) to show this capricious nature of fire.', '2007-10-31 22:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210045, 603787, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exceptional framing and exposure - great out of camera shot.</td>', 'Exceptional framing and exposure - great out of camera shot.', '2007-10-31 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210048, 604542, 30982, '<td valign="top">Title-dependent, but a lot of PJ is.  The only suggestion I''d offer is to have composed so the chair isn''t so centered.  I do like the chair in the shot - it''s so very incongruous with the destruction behind - it looks completely untouched.</td>', 'Title-dependent, but a lot of PJ is.  The only suggestion I''d offer is to have composed so the chair isn''t so centered.  I do like the chair in the shot - it''s so very incongruous with the destruction behind - it looks completely untouched.', '2007-10-31 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210055, 604829, 30982, '<td valign="top">The expressions of the people serve this well, but compositionally could have been a bit better.  I like the inclusion of the TV truck - that tells a bit of the tale.  If you could have, framing it so that you included all of the gentleman and left out whatever was in the foreground would have helped.</td>', 'The expressions of the people serve this well, but compositionally could have been a bit better.  I like the inclusion of the TV truck - that tells a bit of the tale.  If you could have, framing it so that you included all of the gentleman and left out whatever was in the foreground would have helped.', '2007-10-31 22:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210057, 603574, 30982, '<td valign="top">While not typically "photojournalism" this could easily be in the garden or science section of a paper.  Exceptional out of camera capture!</td>', 'While not typically "photojournalism" this could easily be in the garden or science section of a paper.  Exceptional out of camera capture!', '2007-10-31 22:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210058, 602973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Title dependent (which is OK for PJ - much of it often is) but a bit static in composition.  For a human interest story (which I''d assume this would be) you might have wanted to include a human element if possible.</td>', 'Title dependent (which is OK for PJ - much of it often is) but a bit static in composition.  For a human interest story (which I''d assume this would be) you might have wanted to include a human element if possible.', '2007-10-31 22:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210062, 604824, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good choice of a photography to depict what the title indicates the article would be about.  I like it in B&amp;W, and like the DOF used.</td>', 'Very good choice of a photography to depict what the title indicates the article would be about.  I like it in B&W, and like the DOF used.', '2007-10-31 22:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210064, 602482, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good stock shot to use with an article such as that indicated by the title - and a good way to incorporate the gray of the day you chose to shoot.  Well framed in camera.</td>', 'Looks like a good stock shot to use with an article such as that indicated by the title - and a good way to incorporate the gray of the day you chose to shoot.  Well framed in camera.', '2007-10-31 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210066, 603355, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title on this one (could just be my lack of knowledge relating to dingleberries...)  A bit of an awkward composition to me - framing so that the main horizontal line is closer to the top "third" line balances it a bit more.</td>', 'Not sure about the title on this one (could just be my lack of knowledge relating to dingleberries...)  A bit of an awkward composition to me - framing so that the main horizontal line is closer to the top "third" line balances it a bit more.', '2007-10-31 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
