(4215903, 604387, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Brad!  What a powerful photo!   Sad.  Moving. Beautifully done!<br/> <br/>Deserving of every fraction of that <b>7.7573 </b>score!   (WOW!!!)  To be the 3rd highest score that Brad Petersen gets. . .that is SOMETHING!!!    CONGRATULATIONS!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Brad!  What a powerful photo!   Sad.  Moving. Beautifully done! Deserving of every fraction of that 7.7573 score!   (WOW!!!)  To be the 3rd highest score that Brad Petersen gets. . .that is SOMETHING!!!    CONGRATULATIONS!!! ', '2007-11-02 13:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4215914, 602939, 24454, '<td valign="top">Skip!  What an amazing story behind this awesome photo!  I''m in awe of your opportunities. . .and how you bring them to life for us through your work!   THANK YOU!!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Skip!  What an amazing story behind this awesome photo!  I''m in awe of your opportunities. . .and how you bring them to life for us through your work!   THANK YOU!!!!! ', '2007-11-02 14:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4215916, 604395, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhhh.  . .I love this!   It makes my heart hurt!  I love the joy on her face in such a picturesque setting!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohhhhhhhh.  . .I love this!   It makes my heart hurt!  I love the joy on her face in such a picturesque setting! ', '2007-11-02 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4215921, 604354, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go Jon!!  Such an interesting photo composed and executed so amazingly well!  A personal best!   Congratulations!  12th place among the company you are keeping in this challenge is an honor indeed!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Way to go Jon!!  Such an interesting photo composed and executed so amazingly well!  A personal best!   Congratulations!  12th place among the company you are keeping in this challenge is an honor indeed!!! ', '2007-11-02 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
