(4216552, 603787, 84124, '<td valign="top">It''s a great image, I hope you can get a print to the station from which this firefighter is from.  Well deserved blue!</td>', 'It''s a great image, I hope you can get a print to the station from which this firefighter is from.  Well deserved blue!', '2007-11-02 19:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4216558, 604387, 82814, '<td valign="top">I prefer your image over the firefighter image because the latter was too cliche, whereas your "only the memories remain" shot had both emotional and visual power in a unique way.  Having seen both during the voting process I knew the voting would be tight.  This is a truly exceptional image and I think it should have been the blue ribbon winner in this challenge.  Congratulations.  Cheers, Sandra.</td>', 'I prefer your image over the firefighter image because the latter was too cliche, whereas your "only the memories remain" shot had both emotional and visual power in a unique way.  Having seen both during the voting process I knew the voting would be tight.  This is a truly exceptional image and I think it should have been the blue ribbon winner in this challenge.  Congratulations.  Cheers, Sandra.', '2007-11-02 19:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
